# name: qoder-international
# priority: 1910
# section: ai
# description: Qoder 国际产品、自有 API 与插件市场
# boundary: 保留产品专表的qoder.com范围，并按官方完整网络元数据跟随自有域名及*.通配范围；qoder.com.cn中的Global端点属于国际产品，不按后缀误分。阿里云、验证码和外部插件市场等共享范围未并入，本表尚不等同完整服务依赖。服务端出站IP不作为客户端目的地址。
# created-at: 2026-11-21T12:39:08Z
# updated-at: 2026-11-27T00:11:30Z
# source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VPSDance/ai-proxy-rules/main/rules/loon/qoder.list
# source: https://qoder.com/
# source: https://api.qoder.com/v1/public/meta
# source: https://docs.qoder.com/account/teams/openapi/service-egress-ips
# canonical-rule-count: 3
# rule-count: 3
# format: shadowrocket
# canonical: rules/loon/1910-qoder-international.lsr

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qoder.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.qoder.com.cn
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.qoder.sh
